      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-05｜Scherer 2009\n\n**一句话：情绪是成分随时间协同变化的过程。**\n\n[原始来源](https://doi.org/10.1080/02699930902928969)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_verified_6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": -4650,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-06｜Smith & Lazarus 1993\n\n**一句话：情绪和“事情对我的意义关系”有关。**\n\n[原始来源](https://doi.org/10.1080/02699939308409189)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_verified_7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": -4200,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-07｜Geneva Emotion Wheel\n\n**一句话：轮盘可记录单种/混合情绪与强度。**\n\n[原始来源](https://www.unige.ch/cisa/gew)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_verified_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": -3750,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-08｜Leder 2004\n\n**一句话：审美体验有从感知到评价的处理阶段。**\n\n[原始来源](https://doi.org/10.1348/0007126042369811)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_verified_9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": -3300,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-09｜Barrett 2017\n\n**一句话：同一个情绪标签不一定只有一套固定配方。**\n\n[原始来源](https://doi.org/10.1093/scan/nsw154)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_verified_10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": -2850,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-10｜CORE Test 2023\n\n**一句话：关系意义可以做成可验证的理解测验。**\n\n[原始来源](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10607998/)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_verified_11",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": -2400,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-11｜Palmer 2013\n\n**一句话：音乐与颜色可能因相同的情绪联想对应。**\n\n[原始来源](https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1212562110)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2_verified_12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11500,
      "y": -1950,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## P2-12｜AESTHEMOS 2017\n\n**一句话：审美感受被拆成21个测量分量表。**\n\n[原始来源](https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0178899)　❤️｜？｜×"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 4200,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-01｜Gestalt / 分组\n\n**东西先被看作一组，才谈感受。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.3758/BF03200760)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 4670,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-02｜Constructed Emotion / 构建情绪\n\n**同一个感受可能不只有一种构成配方。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.1093/scan/nsw154)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 5140,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-03｜AESTHEMOS / 审美感受量表\n\n**神圣、着迷、困惑别全混成一个情绪词。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0178899)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 5610,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-04｜Awe / 敬畏感\n\n**神圣感可能关联巨大性和理解框架被改变。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.1080/02699930302297)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 6080,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-05｜Music–Color / 音乐与颜色\n\n**音乐颜色相配可能因为它们情绪相似。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1212562110)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 6550,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-06｜Aesthetic Process / 审美过程\n\n**先看见，再理解，最后感受和评价。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.1348/0007126042369811)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 7020,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-07｜CORE Test / 关系测验\n\n**关系意义也能让不同人作答并测一致性。**\n\n[外部研究](https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10607998/)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 7490,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-08｜Incremental Validity / 增量效度\n\n**新方法应比旧方法多解释一点。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.1037/1040-3590.15.4.456)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 7960,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-09｜Mixed Emotions / 混合体验\n\n**正负或矛盾感受可同时存在。**\n\n[外部研究](https://doi.org/10.1037/0033-2909.115.3.401)　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    },
    {
      "id": "p5_verified_10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9430,
      "y": 8430,
      "width": 1030,
      "height": 425,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## P5-10｜创作—反思循环（灵感）\n\n**改一处视觉关系，记录预期与真实感受偏差。**\n\n方法创意（非特定文献）　❤️ 有感觉｜？继续查｜× 没感觉"
    }
  ],
